<a class="internal-link" data-href="#1-현상" href="./https://lts.kr/study/cs/🐽-oracle-char-타입-공백-패딩-—-트러블슈팅-&amp;-재발-방지-가이드.html#1-현상" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">현상</a> <br>
<a class="internal-link" data-href="#2-원인-분석" href="./https://lts.kr/study/cs/🐽-oracle-char-타입-공백-패딩-—-트러블슈팅-&amp;-재발-방지-가이드.html#2-원인-분석" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">원인 분석</a> <br>
